# Working dirs — generated content, not source
review/
AGENT-EXPERIENCE-REVIEW.md

# docs/ is a MIXED folder: `docs/contract.md` is a shipped, tracked spec
# (package.json files[] allowlists exactly that one path). Everything else
# under docs/ is a local working analysis — never committed, never shipped.
# Un-ignore a new doc explicitly when it becomes a real shipped document, and
# add it to files[] at the same time.
docs/*
!docs/contract.md

# Internal planning notes — not shipped, not public repo history.
# (Single spec/planning folder; local-only, all spec workflow lives here.)
.spec/
.spect/

# DeepSeek Harness session data — workspace-local, never in repo history.
.dsh/
